      "value": "@{5fca5df4d58780532024a52b|full_name}: I thought it was meant to be like that, to display the final result with proper perspective. If they do change it now, I hope they add a toggle as i like what they’ve done with it. \nThe canny was meant more so to point out that using the camera with the mirrored preview was disorienting.\nIf they change it so selfie camera is mirrored and rear is not, then there will be obvious inconsistencies between taken photos.",
      "viewerReactions": null
