      "value": "@{5fca5df4d58780532024a52b|full_name}: Mirroring it afterward is what a lot of selfie apps do. When the photo is mirrored, it corrects left & right and makes it look as if it was taken with the rear camera.\nI think the best solution to this is to create a \"mirror image\" button or toggle for the gallery camera result screen.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
