      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "We will be leaving the functionality as-is for release. The live behavior saves a mirrored version of the image to the gallery, which makes any text in the image unreadable. This was fixed in the open beta to save the unmirrored version. I'd like to add a flip button post-release, but can't give an ETA on that yet.",
