  "details": "In live, the gallery camera acts like a reflection but makes your avatar appear flipped the wrong way.\nIn beta, the gallery camera mirrors your selfie and makes your avatar appear from the proper perspective, but also makes taking photos feel disorientating.\nPlease make this a toggle or at least give the option to mirror after the photo is taken.\n\nRecorded 2 clips showing the change.\n\nLive Release:\nhttps://youtu.be/J7uUu2JTqOU\n\nOpen Beta\nhttps://youtu.be/8OKdBFc3ckQ",
